        ecrm:P3_has_note    "The series includes Diana, Neptune, Saturn, Jupiter, Bacchus, Venus, Ceres and Juno, all with their respective attributes. This series is not to be confused with Audran's later and quite similar series of arabesque portières: <i>Les Mois</i> (1709), which are smaller in scale and therefore suitable for residences other than royal palaces."@en ;
